     "body": "Dear Yang Xiu,\n\nThank you for the notice. We have noted that the factory is closed from 1 October to 8 October, that the last shipment before the closure leaves on 28 September, that production resumes on 9 October, and that orders scheduled to ship during the closure will ship on 12 October.\n\nWe saw your 22 September date for pre-holiday requests after it had passed. Could you please send us the current promised dates for all our open PO lines with Meiya that fall between 1 October and 12 October? Where a shipment on 12 October would be later than the date on the PO line, please tell us the revised ship date as soon as you can.\n\nThis is a confirmation of receipt and a request for dates only. It does not change any PO terms or waive any of our rights under the orders.\n\nBest regards,\nTom Albrecht\nHalden Robotics"
